   "source": [
    "**MPNN2 normalization — QuantileTransformer(uniform), not RobustScaler** (2026-08-03, see DECISIONS.md)\n",
    "\n",
    "MPNN2's purpose is to isolate the effect of the 316-feature rmoldes set vs MPNN3's 200-feature\n",
    "rdkit_2d_normalized. Previously MPNN2 fed **RobustScaler'd** rmoldes, which confounded that comparison\n",
    "with a *normalization* difference (linear/unbounded RobustScaler vs MPNN3's bounded [0,1] CDF) and\n",
    "could destabilise the FFN independently of feature content. MPNN2 now uses\n",
    "`QuantileTransformer(output_distribution='uniform')` on the rmoldes (fit on `X_train` only) — the\n",
    "closest analogue to rdkit_2d_normalized's CDF.\n",
    "\n",
    "*Residual limitation:* QT is empirical (fit on our ~1–3k training molecules and clamps out-of-range\n",
    "test values to 0/1); descriptastorus's CDF is parametric (fit on a large external corpus, extrapolates).\n",
    "Same family, minor mechanism difference — acceptable. The old RobustScaler run is preserved as\n",
    "`MPNN2_robustscaler` by the migration cell below; **run it once** before re-running MPNN2."
   ]
